ght, while solar thermal ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"css.umich.edu\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 8,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy – SEIA\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seia.org/initiatives/about-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar Technologies. There are three main ways to harness solar energy: photovoltaics, solar heating & cooling, and concentrating solar power.\",\n      \"domain\": \"seia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy | EESI\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.eesi.org/topics/solar/description\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are two ways to harness solar energy. Passive systems are structures whose design, placement, or materials optimize the use of heat or light directly from ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"eesi.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How does solar power work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationalgrid.com/stories/energy-explained/how-does-solar-power-work\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar power works by converting energy from the sun into power. There are two forms of energy generated from the sun for our use – electricity and heat.\",\n      \"domain\": \"nationalgrid.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 16, 2023\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Where Does Solar Energy Come From?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ecoflow.com/us/blog/where-does-solar-energy-come-from\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The conversion of solar energy into usable electricity begins with photovoltaic (PV) cells, the key component in any panel. Solar cells are constructed from ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"ecoflow.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How Solar Energy Works: Step-by-Step\",\n      \"url\": \"https://palmetto.com/solar/we-break-down-how-solar-energy-works-step-by-step\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar panels convert solar radiation into electricity, then an inverter turns it into the AC electricity that's usable in your home.\",\n      \"domain\": \"palmetto.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"7 days ago\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"How is solar energy harnessed and converted into usable energy? definition\",\n    \"How is solar energy harnessed and converted into usable energy? examples\",\n    \"How is solar energy harnessed and converted into usable energy? 2024\",\n    \"How is solar energy harnessed and converted into usable energy? research\",\n    \"How is solar energy harnessed and converted into usable energy? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 00:20:27"}
